/E (Just as expert consultants cannot speak for adolescents, the opposite is also true - studios should consult both. Multiple generations of AIR reports have shown us that expert ratings of representation strongly predict box office performance. Consultants are essential, helping hone the cultural specificity and avoiding missteps that help representation feel authentic: research shows that it pays to have consultants bring their expertise to projects from the beginning of the production process.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [5 627 0 R 7]
