/P 298 0 R
/T (Minimal roles for characters Adolescents also associated franchises that gave minimal roles to characters with the relevant identity with poor representation. For example, if the character has a minimal impact on the plot, gets sparse characterization, lacks any story arc, or simply does not get to speak or be seen on screen much, they probably have a minimal role, and for adolescents that can really undermine a portrayal of a diverse character. In our data, this is best exemplified by LGBTQ representation, as we explore below.)
/E (Minimal roles for characters Adolescents also associated franchises that gave minimal roles to characters with the relevant identity with poor representation. For example, if the character has a minimal impact on the plot, gets sparse characterization, lacks any story arc, or simply does not get to speak or be seen on screen much, they probably have a minimal role, and for adolescents that can really undermine a portrayal of a diverse character. In our data, this is best exemplified by LGBTQ representation, as we explore below.)
