478 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 298 0 R
/T (For example, the Black Panther franchise is a superhero franchise, but it incorporates elements of African culture and Afrofuturist ideas with enormous care. The franchise is very intentional about including nuggets of African culture throughout the films, from the traditional stacked neck rings in the wardrobe to the use of the South African language Xhosa in dialogue. Instead of the culture being a trait of the character, it is integrated into the world itself. In our data, experts rated Black Panther somewhat highly, but young audiences rated it very highly - the third highest rated franchise overall. The cultural elements resonate with young audiences, and unsurprisingly, the franchise has been incredibly successful. For more info on cultural representation, see the roadmap to AIR.)
/E (For example, the Black Panther franchise is a superhero franchise, but it incorporates elements of African culture and Afrofuturist ideas with enormous care. The franchise is very intentional about including nuggets of African culture throughout the films, from the traditional stacked neck rings in the wardrobe to the use of the South African language Xhosa in dialogue. Instead of the culture being a trait of the character, it is integrated into the world itself. In our data, experts rated Black Panther somewhat highly, but young audiences rated it very highly - the third highest rated franchise overall. The cultural elements resonate with young audiences, and unsurprisingly, the franchise has been incredibly successful. For more info on cultural representation, see the roadmap to AIR.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [4 631 0 R 6]
