/E (Relatability goes hand-in-hand with authentic representation, according to adolescents. Portraying characters with diverse identities with specificity can help audiences get to know and relate to them as individuals, especially when they are given characteristics that young audiences see in themselves.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
501 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 300 0 R
/E (For example, K-Pop Demon Hunters \(2025\) presents characters with personality traits that youth can easily identify with. The movie gives each of the three main characters distinct visual styling and explores their individual struggles in their song verses - a combination which imbues each of them with distinctiveness and relatability. In a particularly clever move, even though the main characters are idols themselves, they consistently show respect for their fans and even engage in fandom themselves. These sequences ground the girls, inviting K-Pop fans watching the movie to relate to them and adding to their authenticity.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [3 635 0 R 5]
>>
