/E (Providing diverse characters with meaningful \(platonic, familial, or romantic\) relationships can help avoid many of the fatal flaws. If the characters have a shared identity, the culture of that identity can be conveyed through the relationship in a way that feels lived in and real. If the relationship is a focus of the story, that gives the story an opportunity to give both characters meaningful roles. If the relationship is written well, it can help audiences understand and relate to the characters.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [3]
>>
