/E (CSS is committed to amplifying youth perspectives and empowering young voices through our Youth Media Representation \(YMR\) program. The YMR program creates a pipeline for authentic youth perspectives to reach the creators shaping their media worlds. By amplifying these voices, YMR promotes more inclusive, accurate representation in media and empowers teens to advocate for themselves and their communities. This work not only benefits participants but also helps support leaders in the entertainment industry to accurately reflect the realities of diverse youth today. For information about our YMR program, follow here!)
