1609 0 obj
<<
/Title (About Our Authentically Inclusive Representation Research This project is the latest in our Authentically Inclusive Representation \(AIR\) series. Previous reports have found that authentically inclusive representation, as rated by advocacy groups like GLAAD, Better Life Labs, Geena Davis Institute, and NHMC, leads to box office success - as well as higher critical and audience ratings of movies and shows. Our Roadmap to AIR report lays out 10 actionable tips to create a production process that leads to more authentic representation.  Click here to read our AIR reports.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 7 0 R
/Prev 1309 0 R
/Next 1833 0 R
>>
endobj
