2039 0 obj
<<
/Title (Consult young people during production. Adolescents, especially those with lived experience of the identity being represented, are strong judges of authentic representation that will resonate, and their demographic is key to franchise success.)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2036 0 R
/Prev 2037 0 R
/Next 2041 0 R
>>
endobj
2040 0 obj
<<
/Title (Build adolescent representation assessment into testing. Adding an explicit measure of perceived authentic representation, especially when your sample includes adolescents, could help predict success for your film and any future installments.)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2036 0 R
/Prev 2042 0 R
/Next 2038 0 R
>>
endobj
2041 0 obj
<<
/Title (Be wary of the three fatal flaws. During writing and production, ask whether the representation in your film has genuine cultural grounding, whether diverse characters have meaningful roles, and whether audiences have the chance to relate to those characters.)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2036 0 R
/Prev 2039 0 R
/Next 2042 0 R
>>
endobj
2042 0 obj
<<
/Title (Don't be afraid to make relationships the center of the story. Relationships between friends, family members, and even romantic relationships can help illustrate the specificity of culture and identity that mark great representation.)
/Dest [25 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2036 0 R
/Prev 2041 0 R
/Next 2040 0 R
>>
